Modifications in this edition
-----------------------------
This fork adds HarmonyOS NEXT support to the upstream Flutter application.
The changes are distributed under the same AGPL-3.0 license, per section 5
and section 13 of the license.

  1. HarmonyOS application shell (ohos/) built on Flutter-OH, using
     FlutterAbility + FlutterPage embedding.
  2. New playback backend "media_core_avplayer" (vendor/media_core_avplayer),
     which drives the native @ohos.multimedia.media AVPlayer and renders
     decoded frames through Flutter's external texture API. This backend is
     selected instead of the upstream libmpv/media-kit backend on Ohos.
  3. Local forks of upstream/third-party Flutter plugins patched for Ohos,
     vendored under vendor/ so the port is reproducible:
       - media_core       (fork of https://github.com/liuchuancong/media_core)
       - media_kit        (fork of https://github.com/Predidit/media-kit)
       - flutter_inappwebview (fork of openharmony-sig)
       - flutter_packages (path_provider / shared_preferences Ohos patches)
     Each vendored component keeps its own LICENSE file.
  4. Adaptations to connectivity detection, player facade backend selection
     and related controllers for the Ohos target (see git history).

